```

The maze becomes the final gameplay section.

---

# Phase 7 — Ending System

Build the result/ending system.

Support:

* Score
* Completion time
* Rank
* Different outcomes
* Replay
* Personalized ending text

---

# Phase 8 — Visual Polish

Improve the overall presentation:

* Typography
* Backgrounds
* Character design
* UI
* Animations
* Transitions
* Sound
* Music where appropriate
* Loading behavior
* Mobile layout

The game should feel like a deliberate product rather than a developer prototype.

---

# Phase 9 — Personalization

Create a content configuration that allows a special edition to be produced without changing core gameplay code.

Potential customization:

```text
name
messages
images
memory cards
questions
objects
