```

The personalized edition should reuse the same game engine.

---

# Phase 10 — Testing & Deployment

Test on:

### Mobile

* Android Chrome
* iPhone Safari
* Different screen sizes
* Touch interaction
* Portrait orientation

### Desktop

* Chrome
* Edge
* Firefox

Test:

* Starting
